# apify push skips what .gitignore lists, and .gitignore lists src/data/ (the bundle bundle.sh writes, kept out of git),
# so the first build failed with ModuleNotFoundError. A "!" line here force-includes files again even when git ignores
# them (apify-cli getActorLocalFilePaths; an older apify-cli without .actorignore support skips them: update it).
# Run sh bundle.sh before apify push.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
!src/data/**/*.py
!src/data/**/*.json
